# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:11
translate english copyright_review_b74394a4:

    # gabby "Kent! Pa-send naman ng notes mo, 'yung hand-annotated. Ipo-post ko sa page ng batch natin, para sa lahat!"
    gabby "Kent! Send me your notes, the hand-annotated ones. I'll post them on our batch's page, for everyone!"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:13
translate english copyright_review_f2007ce5:

    # kent "Urm, Gabby. Gawa ko 'yan. Hindi mo pwedeng i-post nang walang paalam ko."
    kent "Um, Gabby. I made those. You can't post them without asking me."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:14
translate english copyright_review_79e5324d:

    # gabby "Grabe ka! 'Yung ibang notes nga sa internet, libre lahat!"
    gabby "Seriously?! The other notes on the internet are all free!"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:16
translate english copyright_review_6bc06c88:

    # kent "Libre makita, hindi ibig sabihing libre gamitin. Diyan pumapasok ang RA 8293, ang Intellectual Property Code of the Philippines."
    kent "Free to see doesn't mean free to use. That's where RA 8293 comes in, the Intellectual Property Code of the Philippines."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:17
translate english copyright_review_b68c1841:

    # kent "Sa ilalim ng Section 172, protektado na ang isang orihinal na gawa sa mismong sandali na nilikha ito. Essay, larawan, kanta, code. Hindi na kailangang i-register."
    kent "Under Section 172, an original work is protected the very moment it is created. Essay, photo, song, code. No registration needed."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:18
translate english copyright_review_f64654f2:

    # gabby "Eh 'yung code na nakuha ko sa GitHub kagabi?"
    gabby "What about the code I got from GitHub last night?"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:19
translate english copyright_review_0937854e:

    # kent "Karamihan may license na may kondisyon. Kapag walang license, hindi ibig sabihing libre. Nasa gumawa pa rin ang karapatan."
    kent "Most of it has a license with conditions. No license doesn't mean free. The rights still belong to the creator."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:21
translate english copyright_review_98f8d062:

    # gabby "Eh kung AI naman ang gumawa ng code?"
    gabby "And if the AI wrote the code?"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:22
translate english copyright_review_a22eb071:

    # kent "Debatable pa kung sino ang may-ari ng gawa ng AI. Pero kung kinopya ng AI ang gawa ng iba at ginamit mo nang walang credit, ikaw ang haharap sa guro. At posibleng sa batas din."
    kent "Who owns AI-made work is still debated. But if the AI copied someone else's work and you used it without credit, you're the one who faces the teacher. And possibly the law too."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:23
translate english copyright_review_f5b8590c:

    # mc "(Hindi lang pala ito para sa mga IT. Kahit sinong gumagamit ng AI, puwedeng makakopya ng gawa ng iba nang hindi namamalayan.)"
    mc "(So this isn't only for IT people. Anyone who uses AI can end up copying someone else's work without realizing it.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:24
translate english copyright_review_cb1fadf4:

    # kent "May exception: fair use, Section 185. Puwedeng gumamit ng bahagi ng gawa para sa pag-aaral, pananaliksik, o puna, basta patas ang gamit."
    kent "There's an exception: fair use, Section 185. You can use part of a work for study, research, or comment, as long as the use is fair."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:25
translate english copyright_review_48297359:

    # kent "At ayon sa Section 193, may karapatan ang gumawa na mabanggit siya bilang may-akda. Kaya cite, cite, cite."
    kent "And under Section 193, creators have the right to be credited as the author. So cite, cite, cite."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:26
translate english copyright_review_f5d314cc:

    # kent "Hindi ako abogado, ha. Basahin pa rin ang mismong teksto ng batas."
    kent "I'm not a lawyer, okay? Still read the actual text of the law."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:28
translate english copyright_review_9891150a:

    # gabby "Okay, okay! Hindi ko na ipo-post. Pero bakit parang lahat ng sinasabi mo, may section number?"
    gabby "Okay, okay! I won't post it. But why does everything you say have a section number?"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:29
translate english copyright_review_6b259e92:

    # kent "Kasi may quiz ako. Limang tanong."
    kent "Because I have a quiz for you. Five questions."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:30
translate english copyright_review_2bab8d77:

    # gabby "Bakit ba lagi akong may kaibigang may quiz?"
    gabby "Why do I always have friends who have quizzes?"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:53
translate english copyright_q1_correct_6f7b20ef:

    # narrator "(Tama! Ang RA 8293 ang Intellectual Property Code ng Pilipinas, kasama diyan ang copyright.)"
    narrator "(Correct! RA 8293 is the Philippines' Intellectual Property Code, and copyright is part of it.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:58
translate english copyright_q1_wrong_5be3c471:

    # narrator "(Hindi 'yan. Isipin kung aling batas ang tungkol sa intellectual property, hindi sa data privacy o cybercrime.)"
    narrator "(Not that one. Think about which law is about intellectual property, not data privacy or cybercrime.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:82
translate english copyright_q2_correct_a48a6a51:

    # narrator "(Tama! Protektado ang gawa sa mismong paglikha. Hindi kailangang i-register o i-post muna.)"
    narrator "(Correct! A work is protected from the moment it is created. It doesn't have to be registered or posted first.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:87
translate english copyright_q2_wrong_d5d31aa1:

    # narrator "(Hindi 'yan. Kailangan bang may pumayag o may form muna para maging iyo ang sarili mong essay?)"
    narrator "(Not that one. Do you need someone's permission or a form before your own essay becomes yours?)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:111
translate english copyright_q3_correct_d12528ec:

    # narrator "(Tama! I-credit ang gumawa o gumamit ng larawang may bukas na lisensya. Libre makita, hindi laging libre gamitin.)"
    narrator "(Correct! Credit the creator, or use a picture with an open license. Free to see isn't always free to use.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:116
translate english copyright_q3_wrong_3cff4522:

    # narrator "(Hindi 'yan. Hindi lahat ng nasa Google ay libreng gamitin, at lalong hindi puwedeng angkinin.)"
    narrator "(Not that one. Not everything on Google is free to use, and you definitely can't claim it as yours.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:140
translate english copyright_q4_correct_05345d0e:

    # narrator "(Tama! Maikling bahagi, may citation, para sa pag-aaral: halimbawa ng fair use sa Section 185.)"
    narrator "(Correct! A short part, with a citation, for study: an example of fair use under Section 185.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:145
translate english copyright_q4_wrong_b3d61036:

    # narrator "(Hindi 'yan. Isipin kung gaano karami ang kinuha, para saan, at kung may credit.)"
    narrator "(Not that one. Think about how much was taken, what for, and whether there is credit.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:169
translate english copyright_q5_correct_4c3b5ed8:

    # narrator "(Tama! Ikaw pa rin ang mananagot, kahit AI ang nag-generate. Magbanggit ng source at suriin ang output.)"
    narrator "(Correct! You're still the one responsible, even if an AI generated it. Name your source and check the output.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:174
translate english copyright_q5_wrong_cc847427:

    # narrator "(Hindi 'yan. Hindi ka nakakalusot dahil AI ang gumawa. Isipin kung sino ang nag-submit.)"
    narrator "(Not that one. Using an AI doesn't get you off the hook. Think about who submitted it.)"

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:180
translate english copyright_outro_3ca3d2a5:

    # kent "Good. Hindi lang sa exam ang batas. Nasa bawat copy-paste mo."
    kent "Good. The law isn't only for exams. It's in every copy-paste you do."

# game/copyright_ra8293.rpy:182
translate english copyright_outro_d47bfc57:

    # gabby "Sige na, uuwi na ako. Baka may copyright pa 'yung upuang kinauupuan natin."
    gabby "Fine, I'm going home. The chair we're sitting on might have a copyright too."

